1
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:08,160
A few years had passed since we had returned to our home village after our long journey.

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:14,340
I, Bjarni, son of life, was there when we discovered a strange new world in the West

3
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:16,840
and made friends with the Redskin natives.

4
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:22,820
Life in our small village on the coast of Greenland had been quiet and peaceful ever since our return,

5
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:28,800
until that memorable day in May when fate once again put me to the test.
